<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraq's parliament approved the al-Zaidi cabinet while the government rejected PKK ringleaders, and Turkish foreign minister met counterparts in Baghdad during the 52nd OIC foreign ministers session. A terrorist attack struck the Erbil government building, raising security concerns in Iraqi Kurdistan, and Iraq detained seven Ukrainians suspected of plotting an attack on Persian Gulf oil facilities. Kurdistan Region officials reported an investor-friendlier climate according to a US report, and Italy prepared to resume military training and intelligence cooperation with Kurdistan. 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxONm9md2lxTWQ2OHhpbWV0TGVpVHNvRE94ejRhQmFaejFzOEFwNzF5ZG1YbXI4MDVJQU9UMGtZdEo4dUxmQ25Vc2Q3OU9qM1hWWDg4UTRoX3FSLTRxa1h3OFBFZnR2WGF1OUVtcEtNZ2dtRlpZQkpBdjF1NE9tdk93RGpRaGtfQnJYbktVeUQ4eGlXcjZHR2RmZHQtX1pVNWZ5Yi11TTdZSTFpdHBmcWItR29YM2xrSEVha0ZST2dTTnBFNkE1U2VvWk1rQnU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/16/iraq-parliament-approves-al-zaidis-cabinet-amid-growing-economic-concerns&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNZVJGNUZWblk2TXRIdDh4NkVrZWlGb2o3SDdQd0xzaW16VmNpSUx6b0Z4dkFaOEdBd3duRi1HWmtlZlZTODZrZWNyNFBkMHF4djZ2QjNtbHNNVnk4ZHRIb0p1Q3M1ckREbnczd0t1ZWF5dG9aa2V0Q3Jod0thd1VrTTVvajBYUlFNQzFEejRtcnJSZ1dQZDJld01jQTJiWkxQUVNYYWFzS0E2Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQcXBaRnRJdXFTR1M0b0ZjT0xlSWZqQmlMTU8xSEtZc1pEeFVxY3lYbjdISC1XMDhGSi1OTDQzTE9LT200S1djZjgwOUhwQXFVV2FJUDZibjUzUEpEWUpKWmx4MTU1WnlnaGw2cElKWjRYR29TQVlQS0dXNXdfd2lCY3lmYllCMkZEYkFYNHBkRjEzVU5nQlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.